Subject: [PATCH 3/3] test: start nvidia-imex on GB200 (test branch only)

Port of nvrc/imex-gb200 to upstream/main for hardware testing. main has
no pcilibs-rs, so the gate is the GB200 PCI device ID (10de:2941)
instead of Kind::Coherent(Family::Blackwell). Not for upstream; the PR
version stays stacked on #227.

GB200 without IMEX (2026-11-17): CliqueId 32766 on every GPU and NCCL
all_reduce_perf fails with "CUDA-capable device(s) is/are busy or
unavailable", while deviceQuery passes.

